# Git commits

When creating git commits for this project:

- Use only `git commit -m "message"` with a plain message the user asked for.
- Never add `--trailer`, `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor/AI attribution.
- Never mention Cursor, Copilot, or AI tools in commit messages.
